Research Profile: Data Science, Big Data Analytics & Cloud Computing
========================================================================

BIOGRAPHY:
Dr. Sarah Johnson is a leading researcher in Data Science, specializing in large-scale 
predictive analytics, federated learning, and high-performance cloud databases. 
She works on multi-institutional medical and scientific datasets and serves as the 
primary coordinator for the IST Online Journal’s data science and analytics reviewing team.

